# prospect research belongs in the CRM, not in git -- see
# docs/validation/target-account-list.md. Excluded by directory, the way
# data/ above is: a dated copy, a second-quarter register or an underscore
# instead of a hyphen must not be committable. Only the synthetic example
# comes back.
docs/validation/*.json
!docs/validation/*.example.json
*accounts*.json
!docs/validation/target-accounts.example.json
